Attainment & $Q(v) = \lamone \Rightarrow \mu(v/r) = \lamone/r^2$; in particular
$\mu(v/2) = \lamone/4$ \\
Rigidity & $\mu(t) = \lamone/r^2 \iff t \equiv w/r \pmod L$ with $Q(w) = \lamone$ \\
