Packing--covering & squared covering radius $\ge \lamone/4$; $= n/4$ for $\Z^n$, ratio unbounded \\
Sharpened unsolvability & $F = Q + \ell + c$ with completing shift $-v/r$: no integral zero once
$c > 0$ \\
